{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123420/extras/0ae78ef16d61336d80293208918384c5.avif?t=1769324972\" width=378 height=116 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains nearly a hundred carefully selected world-famous paintings, allowing you to effortlessly learn art history while piecing them together. We will also provide long-term free updates, continuously adding more classic artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import local photos to create personalized puzzles (simply rename the image as &quot;Title_Artist_4-digit Year&quot; and place it in a specific folder). Turn precious moments into playable puzzles and create memories that are uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring realistic puzzle mechanics\u2014pieces can be freely dragged and placed, replicating the smooth feel of a physical puzzle. It's not a sliding puzzle, offering more freedom and immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beginner to expert, whether you're new to puzzles or a seasoned pro, you'll find challenges suited to your skill level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why choose &quot;Relaxing Puzzles&quot;?</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recognize famous paintings, learn about master artists, and subtly enhance your artistic knowledge while solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are an effective way to train observation, memory, and logical thinking\u2014quietly boosting your intelligence while having fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple and intuitive rules and easy-to-learn controls, it's suitable for both children and adults, making it an excellent choice for family leisure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game color scheme, and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining education and entertainment, it's perfect for players of all ages. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join now and start your artistic puzzle journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4123420/900768c3f3cee3e928e9c6578177b3aef820aecb.jpg"},{"name":"2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4123420/900768c3f3cee3e928e9c6578177b3aef820aecb.jpg"},{"name":"3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4123420/900768c3f3cee3e928e9c6578177b3aef820aecb.jpg"},{"name":"4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4123420/900768c3f3cee3e928e9c6578177b3aef820aecb.jpg"},{"name":"5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4123420/900768c3f3cee3e928e9c6578177b3aef820aecb.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4123420?t=1769324972","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4123420?t=1769324972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123420/9922fc554224524fc30a986a8d2a84046e406fa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769324972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123420/9922fc554224524fc30a986a8d2a84046e406fa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769324972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123420/extras/0ae78ef16d61336d80293208918384c5.avif?t=1769324972\" width=378 height=116 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains nearly a hundred carefully selected world-famous paintings, allowing you to effortlessly learn art history while piecing them together. We will also provide long-term free updates, continuously adding more classic artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import local photos to create personalized puzzles (simply rename the image as &quot;Title_Artist_4-digit Year&quot; and place it in a specific folder). Turn precious moments into playable puzzles and create memories that are uniquely yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring realistic puzzle mechanics\u2014pieces can be freely dragged and placed, replicating the smooth feel of a physical puzzle. It's not a sliding puzzle, offering more freedom and immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From beginner to expert, whether you're new to puzzles or a seasoned pro, you'll find challenges suited to your skill level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why choose &quot;Relaxing Puzzles&quot;?</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recognize famous paintings, learn about master artists, and subtly enhance your artistic knowledge while solving puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are an effective way to train observation, memory, and logical thinking\u2014quietly boosting your intelligence while having fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple and intuitive rules and easy-to-learn controls, it's suitable for both children and adults, making it an excellent choice for family leisure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the game color scheme, and enjoy the game at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining education and entertainment, it's perfect for players of all ages. </p></li>